      currentAmount: 0
    tutorialTitle: "DENEY F\xD6Y\xDC #01: YA\u015EAMIN KAYNA\u011EI"
    tutorialContent: "Su (H<sub>2</sub>O), iki Hidrojen (H) ve bir Oksijen (O) atomunun
      kovalent ba\u011F yapmas\u0131yla olu\u015Fur. Oksijen, kararl\u0131 yap\u0131ya
      ula\u015Fmak i\xE7in 2 elektrona ihtiya\xE7 duyar ve bunu Hidrojenlerle payla\u015Farak
      \xE7\xF6zer. \\n\\n<b>Laboratuvar G\xF6revi:</b> Matristeki Hidrojen ve Oksijen
      elementlerini yan yana kayd\u0131rarak ilk su molek\xFCl\xFCn\xFC sentezle!"
    tutorialLargeSprite1: {fileID: 21300000, guid: adb3438ae09365a4bb0f0cd62ced123f, type: 3}
    tutorialLargeSprite2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7af5e9bb4d1bc6f498cd552a53912a5d, type: 3}
  - levelName: Level 2
    startingTileCount: 3
    spawnPool:
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 293d81e9e56243149b4c147559fe8972, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 25
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 1e729ce8f726e3f429fe863283cdc9a4, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 25
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 8ba78bf2d4334b0419a90a5e45fec829, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 25
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 9bc756b9524afec44ae66bd1fa8a4950, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 25
    levelGoals:
    - targetPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: a036fab5e06679548b170c3394656328, type: 3}
      targetAmount: 1
      currentAmount: 0
    tutorialTitle: "DENEY F\xD6Y\xDC #02: \u0130YON\u0130K \xC7EK\u0130M"
    tutorialContent: "Sodyum (Na) bir metaldir ve elektron vermeye \xE7ok isteklidir.
      Klor (Cl) ise bir ametaldir ve o elektronu almak i\xE7in can atar. Aralar\u0131ndaki
      bu g\xFC\xE7l\xFC elektron al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015Fi, iyonik ba\u011Fl\u0131
      bildi\u011Fimiz sofra tuzunu (NaCl) olu\u015Fturur! \\n\\n<b>Laboratuvar G\xF6revi:</b>
      Sodyum (Na) ve Klor (Cl) elementlerini h\u0131zla \xE7arp\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rarak
      NaCl molek\xFCl\xFCn\xFC sentezle."
    tutorialLargeSprite1: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 68a315f9c166dcd4f96db42031f5b5ba, type: 3}
    tutorialLargeSprite2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4d17dc4fc753a7c4ea44561797d3d13c, type: 3}
  - levelName: Level 3
    startingTileCount: 4
    spawnPool:
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 293d81e9e56243149b4c147559fe8972, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 15
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 1e729ce8f726e3f429fe863283cdc9a4, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 35
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 8ba78bf2d4334b0419a90a5e45fec829, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 10
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 9bc756b9524afec44ae66bd1fa8a4950, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 10
    - elementPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 930ab50179948a04ea8709f405f40427, type: 3}
      spawnWeight: 30
    levelGoals:
    - targetPrefab: {fileID: 3634079177299486472, guid: 922dddd60ee7f8e4585dfa23774392c1, type: 3}
      targetAmount: 1
      currentAmount: 0
    tutorialTitle: "DENEY F\xD6Y\xDC #03: YA\u015EAMIN D\xD6NG\xDCS\xDC"
    tutorialContent: "Karbondioksit (CO<sub>2</sub>), bitkilerin fotosentez i\xE7in
      kulland\u0131\u011F\u0131 temel gazd\u0131r. Bir Karbon (C) atomu, iki Oksijen
      (O) atomuyla g\xFC\xE7l\xFC \xE7iftli kovalent ba\u011Flar kurarak bu dayan\u0131kl\u0131
      molek\xFCl\xFC in\u015Fa eder. \\n\\n<b>Laboratuvar G\xF6revi:</b> Bir Karbon
      (C) ve iki Oksijen (O) elementini do\u011Fru s\u0131rayla reaksiyona sokarak
      CO<sub>2</sub> gaz\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7\u0131\u011Fa \xE7\u0131kar."
    tutorialLargeSprite1: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f5132c354a504de4fa19bc6279f8b2f2, type: 3}
    tutorialLargeSprite2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3ef09ac4b17efa94196104df79f7beac, type: 3}
