    tutorialTitle: "DENEY F\xD6Y\xDC #04: \xC7OKLU REAKS\u0130YON"
    tutorialContent: "\u0130\u015Fler karma\u015F\u0131kla\u015F\u0131yor! Demir
      (Fe) havadaki Oksijen (O) ile tepkimeye girerek pas\u0131 (Fe<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>)
      olu\u015Fturur. Ayn\u0131 anda, Azot (N) ve Hidrojen (H) birle\u015Ferek temizlik
      malzemelerinin vazge\xE7ilmezi olan amonya\u011F\u0131 (NH<sub>3</sub>) sentezler.
      \\n\\n<b>Laboratuvar G\xF6revi:</b> Matriste iki farkl\u0131 reaksiyonu ayn\u0131
      anda y\xF6net. Hem Fe<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> hem de NH<sub>3</sub> \xFCreterek
      bu zorlu testi ge\xE7!"
    tutorialLargeSprite1: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 467a9526331ac2242931c09f0cedbbe5, type: 3}
    tutorialLargeSprite2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b57b4ec974483334ab61adcfb26dddc3, type: 3}
